Generated by `npx prisma migrate dev --schema ../schema.prisma` the first
time it's run against a real DATABASE_URL. Not pre-generated in this
checkpoint because migration SQL is derived by Prisma's schema-engine at
run time (it needs network access to fetch its engine binary — see
README.md "Running this project" for details). The schema.prisma file is
the source of truth; running the migrate command below will populate this
folder.
